r Co-op<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports 4-player online co-op. Fight solo or alongside friends, cleverly combine each character's strengths to build a powerful lineup, and enjoy a relaxing, thrilling grass-cutting experience!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4246640\/extras\/efc68813076349a5c2232d6f871de0d0.poster.avif?t=1793180731\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4246640\/extras\/efc68813076349a5c2232d6f871de0d0.webm?t=1793180731\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4246640\/extras\/efc68813076349a5c2232d6f871de0d0.mp4?t=1793180731\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vast Skills &amp; Equipment, Free Roguelike Building<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable Heroes: 10 anime-style characters<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill System: 50+ skills to combine freely<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relic System: 80+ randomly dropped relics<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4246640\/extras\/209e2145be047632f5b657c1f49afe96.poster.avif?t=1793180731\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4246640\/extras\/209e2145be047632f5b657c1f49afe96.webm?t=1793180731\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4246640\/extras\/209e2145be047632f5b657c1f49afe96.mp4?t=1793180731\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p cl